verifier provenance note: the verifier was produced from the published fold21
external verifier (K1168 experiment dir) by machine-checked region surgery; during
surgery the C1 tail block (post-fold19 residual-41 checks: fold19 record SHA in W,
frontier recomputation, receipt previous_fold cross-check) was accidentally dropped.
It surfaced as a NameError (fa19) on first execution and was restored by an anchored
splice; the restored previous_fold gate initially failed because the receipt's
previous_fold.record string ends with "(sha256 c02d9a54...)" and was corrected from
endswith to containment of the same fold19 record sha (fail-closed unchanged).
All 1,317 gates pass after the fix; the three canon runs above are post-fix.

